    -   Behavior-modifying feedback tools

By targeting the most frequent accident types and causes, training programs can become more effective, data-driven, and life-saving.# Conclusion

Weather conditions significantly influence both accident frequency and severity, with Clear and Cloudy conditions associated with the highest number of accidents, and Cloudy and Rainy conditions increasing the likelihood of severe outcomes.
